blocking":0},"body":"We've updated our version of ExoPlayer from `2.14.2` to `2.15.0` and we saw a change in our app's generated manifest. Our manifest now contains:\r\n\r\n```\r\n<intent>\r\n        <action android:name=\"android.media.browse.MediaBrowserService\"/>\r\n</intent>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis happened immediately after we upgraded our ExoPlayer version and wanted to confirm this is expected behavior?\r\n\r\nI assume one of ExoPlayer's dependencies requires to declare this intent in the app's manifest? If so, do we know why?\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"sim0629","id":1014342,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTQzNDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1014342?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sim0629","html_url":"https://github.com/sim0629","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sim0629/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sim0629/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sim0629/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sim0629/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sim0629/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sim0629/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sim0629/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sim0629/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sim0629/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9480/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9480/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}